recommend keep-going — the Ethereum transaction family now signs both the flat legacy list (eip155_tx) and the typed type-2 envelope (eip1559_tx). Next tractable rungs: an EIP-4844 blob-transaction (type-3) digest over the same RLP, or the constant-time timing horizon (wants measurement); signing with a real identity key stays the custody gate
